  "local_changes": [
    "Rewrite copied private package imports to the MQLite internal namespace.",
    "Pass one per-database cleanup manager through the HTTP connection constructor.",
    "Replace only Close/closeStream with a shared nonblocking best-effort cleanup path: sixteen active requests, five-second deadline before goroutine launch, no queue or retry; overload increments a skip counter and emits one fixed safe warning.",
    "Clear each captured baton before scheduling or skipping cleanup so serial repeated Close is idempotent.",
    "Adapt the legacy HTTP-only DSN entry point; retain the pinned upstream public SQL parser packages.",
    "Emit the one-time capacity warning only from an existing completed cleanup worker, after network cancellation and slot release; foreground Close never invokes an application logger."
  ],
